T6][S29T7][S29T8].\n- On 2023-11-13, told Dave he's been supporting some young musicians from a music program — supporting their passion is amazing and their enthusiasm is inspiring [S29T9].\n- On 2023-11-13, said of supporting the young musicians \"it's like a torch being passed to keep music alive!\"; the young musicians are very ambitious and he thinks he will support them for a long time (Dave: \"Your support for them keeps the music going and passes on the legacy.\") [S29T11][S29T12].\n- On 2023-11-13, said he's \"stoked [he] made a difference\" — \"paying it forward\" — and that working with new talent brings new ideas to his work; shared a photo of himself making a beat for a young artist (a photo of a man sitting at a desk in front of a computer), saying the artist has great potential in music (Dave: \"Wow, that's cool! Your music studio looks great.\") [S29T13].","text_sha256":"6ad15db03ca7c1f4128c16aa12ca0cc3f16a49c4442f078f7311966296e14eab","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D28:27"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":105,"line_start":105,"source_locators":["[S28T27]"],"text_sha256":"a4f5b3c77c6acbc0bd454e67ce9767435536fb361d46f142ef749964ea92cb00"},{"dia_ids":["D28:29"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":106,"line_start":106,"source_locators":["[S28T29]"],"text_sha256":"a7788649dfb0e4570095c22dda13516f3e16c6b042b34b1db9bcc9bb87231a48"},{"dia_ids":["D28:31"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":107,"line_start":107,"source_locators":["[S28T31]"],"text_sha256":"ac6bf5885466bc9415369acb09cf896a8880caee05184aefd60e967960fcd6b5"},{"dia_ids":["D29:14","D29:15","D29:16"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":108,"line_start":108,"source_locators":["[S29T14]","[S29T15]","[S29T16]"],"text_sha256":"d0f3418f418fae4a12cd0894620b3091112b1dbda0c87cfda8fea44c5f4c2483"}],"dia_ids":["D28:27","D28:29","D28:31","D29:14","D29:15","D29:16"],"evidence_id":"ev-701c3408b6cb7b46b5b