atches much TV: he only works in the studio; he has a separate room for relaxation with a TV (photo of a living room with a couch, chair, television and a table — \"that room is cozy and relaxing\"), which is \"a great way to unwind and get inspired\" [S28T29].\n- On 2023-11-02, when Dave asked what he usually watches on it: he usually watches music videos, concerts, and documentaries about artists and their creative process — \"It's cool to learn more about the industry and see what others do.\" — and it's \"a source of inspiration for me\" [S28T31].\n- On 2023-11-13, when Dave asked whether he's tried out any new ideas lately: he's having fun trying out new sounds and pushing the boundaries — he likes going for new ideas and seeing where they take him, because \"always gotta stay ahead in this\" (a continuation of his 2023-07-21 experimenting-with-genres thread above; Dave: \"Experimenting and pushing boundaries is key to making our art grow\") [S29T14][S29T15][S29T16].","text_sha256":"ede31ab2cb5b80794bfd5c6d1340f919cd0a91e3e8c42e4a71d82af6bbf1627f","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1217,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":27078,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":28295},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"60d0c608bdda6e13c46a9e6cbf4cd7cae4f7eea8d7fcd2d8a4f8f9bde415df7c","filesystem_tools_sha256":"1632a476feccd761a1c6d21c9d2962d0975632f50d6c96678d69427a7f973ed7","orchestration_actions_sha256":"115512fb955e8c7fca557e4b995c5bfd8717ca72dfb184810b04343bc595cd08","paper_prompt_id":"refind-stage1-plus-r3-curated-adapter-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063c